# Demo knowledge pack - taxonomy (lesson 01)
# Classic "is a" chains. PLN derives implicit facts you never stated,
# e.g. that Socrates is mortal.

Socrates is a human
A human is a mammal
A mammal is an animal
An animal is a living_being
A living_being is a mortal_thing

A dog is a mammal
A cat is a mammal
A whale is a mammal
A sparrow is a bird
A bird is an animal

A mammal is a vertebrate
A bird is a vertebrate
A vertebrate is an animal
